<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sets auction of 10.5 bln skr of T-bills.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets auction of 10.5 bln skr of T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Wednesday it would invite bids from the market for an auction of Treasury bills worth 10.5 billion crowns.</p>
<p>The auction will take place on December 18 and bids are due</p>
<p>at 1130 GMT, it said. Settlement date is December 20.</p>
